    "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\n- Refreshed the admin UI Browserslist database data and baseline browser mapping lockfile entries.\r\n\r\n## Motivation\r\n\r\n- Removes non-blocking admin UI build warnings about stale browser compatibility data without changing product behavior.\r\n\r\n## Related Issue\r\n\r\n- Closes #41\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\n- [ ] `npm run test:once`\r\n- [x] `npm run build:admin`\r\n- [ ] relevant local Wrangler validation if applicable\r\n- [ ] I could not run some validation locally, and I explained why below\r\n\r\n## Manual Test Plan / Notes\r\n\r\n- Ran `npm run build:admin` and confirmed the stale `caniuse-lite` / `baseline-browser-mapping` warnings no longer appear.\r\n- The build still reports an unrelated existing warning about `@quasar/app/tsconfig-preset` from the root `tsconfig.json`.\r\n\r\n## Visuals / API Examples\r\n\r\n- [x] No visual change\r\n- [ ] Screenshots, sample payloads, or logs attached if needed\r\n\r\n## Public Artifact Review\r\n\r\n- [x] Titles, descriptions, branch names, and screenshots avoid partner, customer, brand, campaign, or other sensitive external names unless explicitly approved",
